[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_1001","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0010","text":"────太棒了！绝了，绝了！\n超可爱的，雏菜酱！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0020","text":"谢谢～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_1002","text":"助理"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0030","text":"嗯，不过真的不是恭维，是真的可爱\n雏菜酱穿粉色、戴心形都好合适啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_1003","text":"工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0040","text":"蝴蝶结、蕾丝、厚底乐福鞋……\n简直是完美的结合，我都不知道该用什么词来形容了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0050","text":"啊哈～\n雏菜穿什么都好看～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0060","text":"──检查OK！\n雏菜酱，辛苦了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0070","text":"辛苦了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0080","text":"谢谢大家！\n我先失陪了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_1004","text":"助理"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0090","text":"────……唉，真好啊……\n我也……能变得像雏菜酱那么可爱就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32300300_01_0100","text":"………………────"}]
